    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανδρ-ία</span></b>  (in codd. sts. wrongly <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εία,</span> and in later 
